<REAPER_PROJECT 0.1 "7.83/win64" 1793288020 0
  TITLE "Visual Pedalboard demo project using (mainly) MeldaProduction plugins"
  AUTHOR "Randall Dibiasky (https://github.com/rdibiasky)"
  <NOTES 3 3
    |This is a demo of Visual Pedalboard reascript. In order to make it work in your setup, add your MIDI controller and set the input messages in Helgobox Realearn.
    |
    |Plugins used in this demo:
    |Cockos (included in Reaper)
    |https://www.helgoboss.org/projects/realearn (MIDI controller integration)
    |https://www.meldaproduction.com/MFreeFXBundle (Free FX bundle)
    |https://www.tone3000.com/plugin (Amp+Cab simulator)
    |
    |Please install those fantastic plugins before loading this project.
    |
    |Peace,
    |Randall Dibiasky
